Position Availability: 08/16/2027
Required Qualifications
Doctorate with specialization in exercise science, strength and conditioning or closely related field (ABD with completion by summer 2027 will be considered);
Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist (CSCS) credential;
Experience as a provider of exercise science or strength and conditioning services to clients or patients;
Foundation for successful collegiate teaching;
Foundation for active scholarship; and
Ability to work collaboratively with departmental and other university members
